    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/6bd929fecb4b2ba7db336b2919dfb4c1.avif?t=1750329682\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Play like it's 1999! </strong>DERELIKT is a narrative retro FPS inspired by <i>Alien Resurrection</i>, <i>Doom 3</i> and <i>System Shock 2</i>, with a dash of lovecraftian cosmic horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=444 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark hallways of Von Neuman Outpost, an expansive research station grafted onto an anomalous derelict asteroid in orbit around Saturn. Meet over a dozen unique NPCs, manage your inventory, solve oldschool puzzles and fight against eldritch abominations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=444 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DERELIKT</strong> features a faithful and beautiful recreation of PS1 aesthetics, including affine texture warping, dynamic subdivision, lovingly hand painted vertex color and full motion CGI cutscenes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=442 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arguably the most faithful and beautiful recreation of PS1 aesthetics on the market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over a dozen NPCs to meet and talk to in a robust dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an array of classic and outlandish weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >oldschool puzzles in the style of classics like Silent Hill or Resident Evil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique glyph upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 levels in and around a dark space outpost with subtle &quot;Metroidvania&quot; progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/142a44c35a7c268a7bdf80078eb2ba84.avif?t=1750329682\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/6bd929fecb4b2ba7db336b2919dfb4c1.avif?t=1750329682\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Play like it's 1999! </strong>DERELIKT is a narrative retro FPS inspired by <i>Alien Resurrection</i>, <i>Doom 3</i> and <i>System Shock 2</i>, with a dash of lovecraftian cosmic horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=444 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/9a8034c088be65497c512706eabb5255.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark hallways of Von Neuman Outpost, an expansive research station grafted onto an anomalous derelict asteroid in orbit around Saturn. Meet over a dozen unique NPCs, manage your inventory, solve oldschool puzzles and fight against eldritch abominations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=444 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/e813e44298c01c674b9e4b64c5aafc95.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DERELIKT</strong> features a faithful and beautiful recreation of PS1 aesthetics, including affine texture warping, dynamic subdivision, lovingly hand painted vertex color and full motion CGI cutscenes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.poster.avif?t=1750329682\" width=442 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.webm?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/cc774f5e5193fed0c404ec904295b664.mp4?t=1750329682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arguably the most faithful and beautiful recreation of PS1 aesthetics on the market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over a dozen NPCs to meet and talk to in a robust dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an array of classic and outlandish weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >oldschool puzzles in the style of classics like Silent Hill or Resident Evil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique glyph upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 levels in and around a dark space outpost with subtle &quot;Metroidvania&quot; progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810510/extras/142a44c35a7c268a7bdf80078eb2ba84.avif?t=1750329682\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
